{% comment %}
  Main Single Journal Article Section - Moments By Amoraki
  Styled in rich olive green palette (#656D3A / #3B4228 / #F2F5EC).
{% endcomment %}

<article class="sec-single-article">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
    <!-- Article Header -->
    <header class="art-header">
      <nav class="art-breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <a href="/#journal">Journal</a> <span class="sep">/</span> <span class="curr">{{ article.title | default: "Why Presence Outlasts Presents" }}</span>
      </nav>

      <h1 class="art-title">
        {{ article.title | default: "Why Presence Outlasts Presents: The Art of Intentional Gifting" }}
      </h1>

      <p class="art-excerpt">
        {{ article.excerpt | default: "In a world of fast consumption, creating moments of quiet luxury and sensory connection leaves a lasting memory far beyond the material object itself." }}
      </p>

      <div class="art-meta">
        <div class="art-author">
          <div class="art-avatar">A</div>
          <div class="art-author-info">
            <span class="art-author-name">Amoraki Studio</span>
            <span class="art-author-role">Curated Reflections</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="art-meta-details">
          <span class="art-date">{{ article.published_at | date: '%B %d, %Y' | default: 'September 15, 2026' }}</span>
          <span class="art-dot">•</span>
          <span class="art-read-time">5 min read</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Image -->
    <div class="art-hero">
      {% if article.image %}
        <img src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="{{ article.title | escape }}" class="art-hero-img">
      {% else %}
        <img src="{{ 'journal-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Why Presence Outlasts Presents" class="art-hero-img">
      {% endif %}
      <span class="art-hero-caption">Crafted bronze Kansa cup and organic Himalayan herbs — featured in the Moment of Care hamper.</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Article Content Body -->
    <div class="art-body">
      {% if article.content != blank %}
        {{ article.content }}
      {% else %}
        <!-- Rich Sample Article Content with Olive Accents -->
        <p class="art-lead">
          There is a quiet power in slow objects. When we unwrap a thoughtfully curated gift, our hands don't just touch paper and ribbon — we sense the time, consideration, and quiet devotion that went into choosing every single item.
        </p>

        <p>
          In modern life, gifting has often been reduced to speed and convenience: a quick online order, a mass-produced catalogue item, or a transaction checked off a list. But at Amoraki, we believe that true luxury lies in stillness. It lives in the resonance of a hand-hammered Kansa bowl, the gentle aroma of small-batch soy candles, and the warmth of a freshly brewed herbal infusion.
        </p>

        <!-- Olive Callout Blockquote -->
        <blockquote class="art-quote">
          <svg class="art-quote-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
          </svg>
          <p>"A gift is never merely an object passed between hands. It is a physical anchor for a memory — a quiet message that says, <em>I see you, and I honor your time.</em>"</p>
          <cite>— Amoraki Philosophy Deck</cite>
        </blockquote>

        <h2>The Elements of Sensory Intention</h2>
        <p>
          When designing a moment of pause, we look at how objects interact with our senses. Sensory memory is the deepest form of memory human beings experience. A scent can instantly transport us back to a peaceful morning, while the weight of handcrafted metal ground us in the present moment.
        </p>

        <!-- Olive Key Takeaways Box -->
        <div class="art-highlight-box">
          <h3 class="art-box-title">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
            Three Principles of Slow Gifting
          </h3>
          <ul class="art-box-list">
            <li><strong>Purpose over Abundance:</strong> Choose 4 to 5 meaningful items that complement each other rather than overwhelming with filler.</li>
            <li><strong>Craftsmanship &amp; Provenance:</strong> Support artisans who use traditional methods — hand-hammering bronze, whole-leaf organic harvesting, and small-batch pouring.</li>
            <li><strong>The Packaging Ritual:</strong> Unwrapping should be an unhurried experience. Reusable linen boxes and custom wax seals elevate anticipation.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <h2>Building Your Own Evening Rest Ritual</h2>
        <p>
          To bring presence into your daily life, start with small, deliberate steps. Light a botanical soy candle 30 minutes before sleep, pour warm chamomile tea into a bronze Kansa vessel, and allow the evening to slow down to a natural, gentle rhythm.
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <!-- Article Tags & Social Share Footer -->
    <footer class="art-footer">
      <div class="art-tags">
        <span class="art-tag-label">Tags:</span>
        <a href="/#journal" class="art-pill-tag">#SlowGifting</a>
        <a href="/#journal" class="art-pill-tag">#KansaCraft</a>
        <a href="/#journal" class="art-pill-tag">#Mindfulness</a>
        <a href="/#journal" class="art-pill-tag">#AmorakiMoments</a>
      </div>

      <div class="art-share">
        <span>Share this story:</span>
        <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?text={{ article.title | default: 'Why Presence Outlasts Presents' | url_encode }}%20{{ canonical_url | url_encode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="art-share-btn">WhatsApp</a>
        <a href="https://pinterest.com/pin/create/button/?url={{ canonical_url | url_encode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="art-share-btn">Pinterest</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <!-- Related Articles Strip -->
  <section class="art-related">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="art-related-head">
        <span class="tag tag--olive">Keep Reading</span>
        <h2>More Stories from the Journal</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="art-related-grid">
        {% assign related_blog = blog | default: blogs['news'] %}
        {% if related_blog != blank and related_blog.articles.size > 0 %}
          {% for rel_article in related_blog.articles limit: 3 %}
            {% if rel_article.id != article.id %}
              <a href="{{ rel_article.url }}" class="edit-item">
                {% if rel_article.image %}
                  <img class="edit-img" src="{{ rel_article.image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ rel_article.image.alt | default: rel_article.title }}">
                {% else %}
                  <img class="edit-img" src="{{ 'journal-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ rel_article.title }}">
                {% endif %}
                <span class="edit-caption">{{ rel_article.title }}</span>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        {% else %}
          <a href="/blogs/news/the-art-of-slow-gifting" class="edit-item">
            <img class="edit-img" src="{{ 'journal-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="The Art of Slow Gifting">
            <span class="edit-caption">The Art of Slow Gifting</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/blogs/news/beyond-the-occasion" class="edit-item">
            <img class="edit-img" src="{{ 'journal-3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Beyond the Occasion">
            <span class="edit-caption">Beyond the Occasion</span>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Main Article",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
